<TITLE>Automatic Transmission Fluid</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Toyota Genuine ATF WS has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>By lowering the viscosity in the actual operating temperature range, drag loss has been reduced, achieving excellent fuel economy.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>By keeping the viscosity in the high temperature range equivalent to conventional ATF, an oil film is maintained on part surfaces to help prevent wear and seizure.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
